tdepackagekit-trinity (0.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show application icons when apt-config-icons is installed.
  * Make the error details window resizable.
  * Show the notifier's tray icon from login, with an option to hide it
    when there are no updates.
  * Add a handbook for KHelpCenter and man pages.
  * Version numbers now follow the release tags.

